<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RUT_Vorrel_Recipes.xml                   DESERT_STAGGERSEED_BUILD_1

  The preparation desert.md §4b turns on: "Prepared correctly, the
  preparation lets them begin to grow and then perish before they can hurt
  you — producing euphoria. A dish that is a controlled near-miss with a
  lethal parasite. ... the margin for error is the flavour."

  The margin for error is expressed the only way the vanilla bill system can
  express it without new C#: skillRequirements. Cooking 8 is high — higher
  than lavish meals (no requirement) and than pemmican — and a colony without
  a cook that good simply cannot attempt the dish. That is the sheet's
  "margin for error" as a gate on WHO may try, rather than a random chance of
  poisoning, which would land as noise rather than as skill.

  Standalone RecipeDef with no ParentName, deliberately: inheriting
  CookMealBase would drag in its FoodRaw-wide defaultIngredientFilter and
  ingredients list, and this recipe must take exactly one thing. Same shape
  RotSporeKit's own live-prep recipes use one mod over.

  recipeUsers are the three vanilla cooking stations by defName rather than a
  recipeUsers-side patch, so a stove from a mod we do not have installed is
  simply not listed instead of failing a xpath.
-->
<Defs>

  <RecipeDef>
    <defName>RUT_Cook_VorrelSeedDish</defName>
    <label>prepare vorrel</label>
    <description>Wake a batch of vorrel and cook it to the exact point where the seeds will germinate in the diner and then die short of doing harm. Done wrong it is simply a fatal meal.</description>
    <jobString>Preparing vorrel.</jobString>
    <workAmount>900</workAmount>
    <workSpeedStat>CookSpeed</workSpeedStat>
    <workSkill>Cooking</workSkill>
    <requiredGiverWorkType>Cooking</requiredGiverWorkType>
    <effectWorking>Cook</effectWorking>
    <soundWorking>Recipe_CookMeal</soundWorking>
    <allowMixingIngredients>false</allowMixingIngredients>
    <skillRequirements>
      <Cooking>8</Cooking>
    </skillRequirements>
    <ingredients>
      <li>
        <filter>
          <thingDefs>
            <li>RUT_VorrelFruit</li>
          </thingDefs>
        </filter>
        <count>12</count>
      </li>
    </ingredients>
    <fixedIngredientFilter>
      <thingDefs>
        <li>RUT_VorrelFruit</li>
      </thingDefs>
    </fixedIngredientFilter>
    <defaultIngredientFilter>
      <thingDefs>
        <li>RUT_VorrelFruit</li>
      </thingDefs>
    </defaultIngredientFilter>
    <products>
      <RUT_VorrelSeedDish>1</RUT_VorrelSeedDish>
    </products>
    <recipeUsers>
      <li>ElectricStove</li>
      <li>FueledStove</li>
      <li>Campfire</li>
    </recipeUsers>
    <displayPriority>600</displayPriority>
  </RecipeDef>

</Defs>
